{"unit_id":"Tokeii0__dsh-lovelyaudit#readme-1","repo":"Tokeii0/dsh-lovelyaudit","commit":"89de08c2865485105c6e501075b8cd8708236a6f","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lovelyaudit README · dsh-lovelyaudit：DSH 侧边栏 **黑盒/代审**：P0–P7 测绘、点子、漏洞专项报告（含 PoC/EXP）。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-lovelyaudit"}
{"unit_id":"Tokeii0__dsh-lovelyaudit#readme-2","repo":"Tokeii0/dsh-lovelyaudit","commit":"89de08c2865485105c6e501075b8cd8708236a6f","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lovelyaudit README · 安装：```bat\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/Tokeii0/dsh-lovelyaudit/releases/latest/download/dsh-lovelyaudit.tgz\n```\n\n装完重启 DSH。侧边栏底部出现 **黑盒/代审** 即成功。\n\n`dsh plugin add` 会自动把本包写进 web profile 的 `bundles`，不用手改 `package.json`。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"Tokeii0__dsh-lovelyaudit#readme-3","repo":"Tokeii0/dsh-lovelyaudit","commit":"89de08c2865485105c6e501075b8cd8708236a6f","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lovelyaudit README · 更新：先卸载旧版再装最新版：\n\n```bat\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-lovelyaudit\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/Tokeii0/dsh-lovelyaudit/releases/latest/download/dsh-lovelyaudit.tgz\n```\n\n重启 DSH 生效。目标台账、漏洞、设置都不受影响（存在 `~/.dsh` 下，不在插件包里）。","source":"extracted","section":"更新"}
{"unit_id":"Tokeii0__dsh-lovelyaudit#readme-4","repo":"Tokeii0/dsh-lovelyaudit","commit":"89de08c2865485105c6e501075b8cd8708236a6f","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lovelyaudit README · 使用：配置页填目标 URL，可选账号、Header、红线、CTF / Goal，点开始。进度看「目标」，漏洞看「漏洞」。\n\n<img width=\"985\" height=\"965\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44b35cd8-64dd-47d4-bedb-a4a54eb96b95\" />","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
